I am trying to use the RODBC library within rApache to connect to a MS SQL server using unixODBC and FreeTDS.  I have everything set up correctly and can succesfully connect to and execute queries against the database using isql.  I can also load R as root and run commands with RODBC without error.  However, when trying to run in rApache, it cannot connect to the database.  I get the errors "[unixODBC][FreeTDS][SQL Server]Unable to connect: Adaptive Server is unavailable or does not exist" and "Unable to connect to data source" in the apache error log.  Can anyone offer any advice why these would only fail in rApache?  Thanks!

